			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Alrani"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 715551001,
					"content": "Thank you so much. I thought I was truly finished... that group of Treasure Hoarders had been following me this entire time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551002,
					"content": "Just as I had finally made some progress in my research, and was thinking that it might be nice to find the treasure here and take it back with me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551003,
					"content": "The Treasure Hoarders invaded my camp, nabbed me, and brought me here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551004,
					"content": "They kept questioning me as to the treasure's location, and threatened to take my life if I refused to tell them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551005,
					"content": "But if I had told them just like that, that really would have been the end of me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551006,
					"content": "*sigh* I should've listened to Soraya. She always insists that archaeologists like us should be focused on academic results instead of treasure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551007,
					"content": "But I only get this much funding. A few essays won't be enough to break even on my travel expenses...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551008,
					"content": "I can't for the life of me say how Soraya's managed to stay in Liyue by herself for all this time. Just looking at her pile of rejected manuscripts makes me feel exhausted.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551009,
					"content": "What do you plan to do now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551010
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715551010,
					"content": "Well, what else? I've finished gathering my research material. As for the treasure... Well, you can have it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551011,
					"content": "I'm not repeating the convoluted thought process that brought me here. All you need to know is that the treasure is buried <color=#00E1FFFF>underneath that giant golden tree</color> in the middle of Lingju Pass.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551012,
					"content": "Take it if you want. I'll write its description down for you so you don't forget.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551013,
					"content": "I'll rest for a while, and then I'll head back to my camp to gather up my things. I have to get out of here as soon as possible, lest more Treasure Hoarders come here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551014
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551014,
					"content": "I've no idea how long it'll take to get from here to Wangshu Inn. I can only hope that Soraya hasn't already left by the time I get there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715551015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 715551015,
					"content": "*sigh* If only Soraya could be my tutor...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				}
			]
		},
